 - 2026-06-13: Operational retrospective for milestone 2026.06.383. The authoritative milestone-scoped timing detector false-zeroed AGAIN (0 experiment commits since activation; both 3090s idle with 0 compute-bound tasks, so the idle GPU is correct and gpu_idle_on_compute_bound_tasks=null) -- the recurring false-zero documented across .363-.382. Per the on-disk ops/changelog.md window read this turn, .383 actually shipped exp4135-exp4144: the fixed-LR Sudoku-Extreme baseline did NOT converge toward 0.87 (config-blocked -- Lightning stopped immediately on an already-elapsed Timer before metrics were written; val stuck at 0.2782), so the DECISIVE Carnot-verifier graft (exp4139) returned uninformative_no_headroom/FALSE_NEGATIVE_RISK and verifier_value_added stayed unproven (DiffusionGemma kept gated); ARC made incremental progress but no verifier-validated level-up (exp4140, r11l L5); SOTA ingestion (exp4141, GRAM-as-generator flagged for .384) + registry/gaps hygiene (exp4142) + hardware continuity (exp4143: PolarFire hash-verified CPU dispatch OK, GateMate n=16 flash blocked/unreachable, KV260 terminal) landed; capstone exp4144 BLOCKED, 6 flagged-skipped. Highest-leverage fix unchanged: repair the timing detector's commit-attribution scan so retros get real per-experiment durations. results/operational_retro_2026_06_383.json
 - 2026-06-13: Archive .383 -> activate .384; KEEP the hardened green-gate + poison-test quarantine. Assert research-complete.yaml + ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml parse under yaml.safe_load and nano-trm/src/nn/train.py is present; run the smart-subset pre-test gate green; RECORD the .383 close-state truth (accumulation NO-OP'd at the max_epochs cap, baseline stuck at 0.278, decisive graft deferred uninformatively -> .384 fixes the cap). (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: archived_v383_v384_active_max_epochs_noop_recorded_baseline_0.278_graft_false_negative_risk_pretest_green; results/experiment_4145_archive_v383_activate_v384.json
 - 2026-06-13: ACCUMULATE pass 1 — DIAGNOSE + FIX the max_epochs cap, then resume-train from the intact 0.278 checkpoint. Raise max_epochs above the checkpoint's current epoch so trainer.fit() continues (instead of the 7s instant-return that no-op'd .383); resume via ckpt_path; bound <=60 min via max_time; ANTI-NO-OP guard (duration>120s AND epoch advanced AND real val read). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_noop_cap_not_confirmed_timer_elapsed; results/experiment_4146_sudoku_accumulate_pass1_epochfix.json
+- 2026-06-13: ACCUMULATE pass 2 (DEFENSIVE read of pass1). If pass1 trained (epoch advanced, real val), resume from the stable checkpoint with the SAME epoch-ceiling-raise + max_time + anti-no-op guard and train another <=60 min; report val + delta. If pass1 was blocked_noop, do NOT blind-retry — surface the unresolved config cause. (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_pass1_noop_unresolved; results/experiment_4147_sudoku_accumulate_pass2.json
